-- Smash history: the sets of 2006's and 2007's Melee majors that have a Liquipedia bracket page, read by hand
-- (round 734's way; Matthew, 2026-11-22: "Continue"). Liquipedia keeps the later rounds of most of these brackets,
-- not every set; scores as it lists them (none where it only marks the winner); forfeits left out. Made with
-- tools/liquipedia/bracket-to-sql.mjs from tools/liquipedia/brackets/2006-2007-melee.txt. Safe to run twice.

-- manual/2006-mlg-dallas-2006 (melee): 62 sets, from https://liquipedia.net/smash/MLG/2006/Dallas/Singles_Bracket
on conflict (set_id) do update set round = excluded.round, sort_order = excluded.sort_order, p1_name = excluded.p1_name,
  p1_score = excluded.p1_score, p2_name = excluded.p2_name, p2_score = excluded.p2_score, winner = excluded.winner;

